# Check out LF on every platform.
#
# .prettierrc sets endOfLine: "lf". Without this, a Windows checkout with
# core.autocrlf=true converts every file to CRLF and `prettier --check` fails
# on the whole tree - which is exactly what the windows-latest CI job hit
# while the ubuntu jobs passed.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
